import R4333Lean.ProfileDUUUDegreeTenCatalogOrbits61
import R4333Lean.CriticalK15PartitionClassification

/-!
# Finite candidate data for the normalized UUU degree-ten catalogue

After the colour-preserving critical-K15 normalization, the three fixed
five-sets map to the three canonical template parts.  Each restriction has
exactly ten compatible labelings.  The tables here list those labelings and,
for every one of the resulting `2 * 10^3` candidates, an index in the
authoritative 600-row catalogue.

Subsequent modules prove both completeness of the ten local maps and every
candidate/catalogue equation by bounded kernel reduction.
-/

namespace R4333
namespace ProfileDUUUDegreeTenCatalogCompletenessData61

open SingleRootStarCNF
open CriticalK15PartitionClassification
open ProfileDUUUDegreeTenCatalogOrbits61

set_option maxRecDepth 1000000
set_option maxHeartbeats 0

